:m The class is named `ShapeVisitor` because it represents an abstraction of shape operations. Using this name helps others understand that the purpose of the class is to define operations on shapes, making the code more self-explanatory and adhering to "Guideline 14: Use a Design Pattern's Name to Communicate Intent."
