:m The text explains that by creating abstractions like `PersistenceInterface`, one can decouple higher-level logic from specific implementations, making it easier to swap out different database systems. The `get_persistence_interface()` function and `set_persistence_interface()` provide a way to set the global state without hardcoding dependencies on concrete implementations.
