:m The `ObjectMapper` class simplifies JSON parsing and writing by converting between Java objects and JSON data. It can read JSON strings into Java objects (`readValue`) and write Java objects to JSON strings (`writeValueAsString`). This makes it easier for developers to handle JSON data without manually managing the conversion logic.
```java
// Code example for using ObjectMapper
