V = initialize_value()
C = 0
for episode in episodes {
for step t from T-1 to 0 {
G += R_{t+1}
C += W
if At != π(St) then break // Exit inner loop if action taken is not greedy
V = V + (W * (G - V)) / C
C += W
}
}
```

