bankAccount.withdraw(request.getBook().getCost());
bankAccount.withdraw(request.getCar().getCost());
return true;
}
return false;
}
}
```

:m Atomicity ensures that every transaction either fully completes or nothing at all happens, preserving data integrity. For example, if you buy both a book and a car with your bank account balance:
